[al:新概念英语（四）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:The Search for Oil]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:00.31]Lesson 13 | 第13课
[00:02.42]The search for oil | 寻找石油
[00:10.79]What do oilmen want to achieve as soon as they strike oil? | 石油工人一旦找到石油，就想立即达到什么目的？
[00:16.98]The deepest holes of all are made for oil, and they go down to as much as 25, 000 feet. | 世界上最深的洞是为找石油而打的，深达25000英尺。
[00:26.09]But we do not need to send man down to get the oil out, as we must with other mineral deposits. | 但我们不必像开采其他矿藏那样，把人送到下面去把油取出来。
[00:34.31]The holes are only borings, less than a foot in diameter. | 这些洞只是钻孔，直径不到一英尺。
[00:40.18]My particular experience is largely in oil, and the search for oil has done more to improve deep drilling than any other mining activity. | 我的具体经验主要在石油方面，寻找石油对改进深钻技术的贡献超过其他任何采矿活动。
[00:52.31]When it has been decided where we are going to drill, | 一旦确定了钻井的地点，
[00:56.08]we put up at the surface an oil derrick. | 我们就在地面上竖起一座井架。
[00:59.84]It has to be tall because it is like a giant block and tackle and we have to lower into the ground | 井架必须很高，因为它像一个巨大的滑轮组，我们必须把很长的钻杆
[01:06.82]and haul out of the ground great lengths of drill pipe which are rotated by an engine at the top | 降到井里，再从井里拉出来，钻杆由井架顶部的发动机带动旋转，
[01:13.84]and are fitted with a cutting bit at the bottom. | 其底部装有钻头。
[01:17.95]The geologist needs to know what rocks the drill has reached, | 地质学家需要知道钻头已到达什么岩层，
[01:22.67]so every so often a sample is obtained with a coring bit. | 因此时不时用取芯钻头取一个样品。
[01:28.11]It cuts a clean cylinder of rock, from which can be seen the strata the drill has been cutting through. | 它切出一个完整的圆柱形岩石，从中可以看出钻头一直在钻穿的地层。
[01:36.45]Once we get down to the oil, it usually flows to the surface because great pressure either from gas or water, is pushing it. | 一旦到达油层，石油通常会喷到地面上来，因为有巨大的压力，不是来自气体就是来自水，在推着它。
[01:46.93]This pressure must be under control, and we control it by means of the mud which we circulate down the drill pipe. | 这种压力必须加以控制，我们靠往钻杆里循环泵送泥浆来控制它。
[01:56.22]We endeavour to avoid the old, romantic idea of a gusher, which wastes oil and gas. | 我们尽量避免老式的、浪漫的喷油井观念，那会浪费石油和天然气。
[02:04.33]We want it to stay down the hole until we can lead it off in a controlled manner. | 我们要让石油留在井底，直到我们能以有控制的方式把它引出来。
